{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41480","headline":"梅花寄所亲 · 李建勳","name":"梅花寄所亲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一气才新物未知，每慙青律与先吹。\n雪霜迷素犹嫌早，桃杏虽红且後时。\n云鬓自黏飘处粉，玉鞭谁指出墙枝。\n老夫多病无风味，只向尊前咏旧诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41480.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41480","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}